  (b) firm to furnish him with a return of the names and addresses of the partners of the firm and their respective shares;
  (c) Hindu undivided family to furnish him with a return of the names and addresses of the manager and the members of the family;
  (d) person whom he has reason to believe to be a trustee, guardian or agent, to furnish him with a return of the names of the persons for or of whom he is
    trustee, guardian or agent, and of their addresses;

(e) "computer system" means computers, computer networks, computer resources, communication devices, digital or electronic data storage devices, used
